# Official logo

The logo file is `public/eton-safaris-gorilla.png`. `SITE_LOGO` in `lib/collections.ts` must point at `/eton-safaris-gorilla.png`.

That artwork is a deep charcoal (`#2B2B2B`) gorilla with white ETON SAFARIS lettering standing on an earthy orange (`#C45A27`) ground.

Do not point the site at Base44 OvalLogo URLs. Header, footer, admin, and tab icon all use `SITE_LOGO`. Only the browser tab title may change per page.

Do not add redirects from `/icon.png`, `/apple-icon.png`, or `/favicon.ico` — those loops crash the site on refresh.
